### Requires server: .venv\Scripts\python.exe manage.py runserver 127.0.0.1:8000
### Extension: REST Client (humao.rest-client) -> click "Send Request" above each block

### 1. Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/health/

### 2. Short coordinate route
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/routes/optimize-fuel/
Content-Type: application/json

{"start":{"latitude":40.7128,"longitude":-74.0060},"finish":{"latitude":40.7357,"longitude":-74.1724}}

### 3. Long coordinate route
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/routes/optimize-fuel/
Content-Type: application/json

{"start":{"latitude":40.7128,"longitude":-74.0060},"finish":{"latitude":41.8781,"longitude":-87.6298}}

### 4. Saved map - paste trip_id from step 2/3 response
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/routes/REPLACE_WITH_TRIP_ID/map/
